{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dd3eee7d9e807c7ddbebb860dfec6826d09e7f3b0d5899dc4f4758aced1fdf38", "ja": "（BIRTHの公演アンケートを集計していたら、\n遅くなってしまったな。結果は明日みんなに……）", "zh": "（忙着统计『BIRTH』公演的问卷，不知不觉这么晚了。\n明天再把结果告诉大家……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1001_p", "source_sha256": "dd931476130538c50b0e747484e9095bbcd33ed7cf1578f653f26b66e9037f5e", "ja": "（……ん？　こんな時間なのに、\nトレーニングルームに明かりが……？）", "zh": "（……嗯？都这个时间了，\n训练房还开着灯……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "83c6d7d443cd1f40aa1c440c97ab99c8e9c45395598c6da73903b303547c51a7", "ja": "ふぅ。\n今のは、どうだったかしら……？", "zh": "呼……\n不晓得刚才的怎么样呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1003_p", "source_sha256": "76126ca1e089905aaaf922485cdb258bce63d083d9ef878ff73bddcbd73e5a15", "ja": "あずささんじゃないですか。", "zh": "这不是梓小姐吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "74f9e49e85b5a71ac1f0e497ac1fa055424ca9c8bb2deff62f729caf394d8adc", "ja": "あら、{$P$}さん……あっ、もう\nこんな時間に？　私ったら、ちっとも気づかなくて。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}先生……\n啊，已经这么晚了吗？我真是的，完全没注意到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1005_p", "source_sha256": "63b73e1dd6b48a3cd9f165938ee8f3546bd593309b261fc36d4e39669ceeed94", "ja": "居残りで自主レッスンですか？\nもうBIRTHの公演は終わったのに……。", "zh": "你留下来做自主练习吗？\n『BIRTH』的公演不是都已经结束了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "9158524d60e67897e6d7c4c3300a765bcfc8345d46b9868bd7b2275dc4e9af3c", "ja": "ええ。でも、本番で、ちょっと怪しかったところが\nあって……おさらいしておこうって思ったんです。", "zh": "是啊，不过正式上场时，有个地方感觉不太对……\n所以我想要做个复习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "46428d5ac7bca4932b85de8ab100ed4211fd36f80aca7d4b042d63e6278d9a55", "ja": "みんな、とっても頑張っていましたから。\n私も見習わなくちゃと思って。", "zh": "毕竟大家都非常努力，\n我想自己也得向她们看齐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "cd01c03b7e70beb82449f22419da6c7d84d5fb4a2b589c619e7b8bc69eaabaa1", "ja": "それに、いつまたBIRTHのみんなと\n歌うことになるか、わかりませんものね♪", "zh": "再说了，或许哪天又有机会，\n可以再和『BIRTH』的各位一起演唱啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ed2916f014b76eb5af265f0c5c9c874070b78fc0cec534ac5d894079085fcccb", "ja": "そういうことですか……。それじゃ、これからは\n俺も、そのレッスンに付き合わせてもらえますか？", "zh": "原来如此……\n那么，以后我可以也陪你一起训练吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "ab463d2b3409a8edf31af3b053bd1f481ca3f7225623e5356d53fe659ea14f96", "ja": "あら。うれしいですけれど、お忙しいのに……。\nいいんですか？", "zh": "哎呀，我当然很乐意，但你那么忙……\n真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9dc5fe577eda4a7b71a007a7931c2f1d6e3792ad07202c0057f5dbe16ef7466c", "ja": "もちろんです。俺もいつまたBIRTHをプロデュース\nすることになるか、わかりませんからね。", "zh": "那当然，因为或许哪天我又有机会，\n能够再次培育『BIRTH』啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "1946ca2267adcc7e4f533e125b078d545cbf3db8cd48707912d1606bfc86188f", "ja": "まあ……。\nありがとうございます♪", "zh": "那还真是……\n非常谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f4ff5af0b58ed00a9ddcbcb4485e86066c8a81f9579d9f6969840fa6f78fccb6", "ja": "けど、その前に……\nひとつ報告してもいいですか？", "zh": "但在那之前……\n我可以报告一件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "43d3c6fba2a390611692f44454ed61c5a94943c96d930f78af693e4101b1ce86", "ja": "はい、なんでしょう？", "zh": "可以啊，什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1015_p", "source_sha256": "90629b45e8d1a233f9bdd4048ad6ce4fc06c90862edec6202c5811152840443c", "ja": "BIRTHのみんなが頑張れたのは、あずささんの\n優しいフォローがあってこそだったと思います。", "zh": "我认为『BIRTH』的大家之所以能够努力，\n正是因为有梓小姐这位温柔的后盾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6c5106689fd58d2498caecf6e9f2050276963ffe2e8f6432c287692b589b0e5e", "ja": "それに、あずささんだって今回のステージで、たくさん\n成長したと思います。見てください、このアンケート。", "zh": "而且，我认为梓小姐也在这次表演中成长许多。\n你看看这份问卷调查。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "e6603510adfb58a37bda070163dfdddfc3bd10ee1cc49a49917134999b686ebd", "ja": "まあ、こんなにたくさん……！　BIRTHの公演は、\n本当に大勢の方に、楽しんでいただけたんですね？", "zh": "哎呀，有这么多……！\n看来『BIRTH』的公演，真的让许多人都很尽兴呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1018_p", "source_sha256": "14812a19d33e6eb07870af306a3e5ccd0060a4ca431c5559799481fa0c2fc73e", "ja": "そうなんです。だから、自信を持ってくださいね。\n俺も引き続き、あずささんを全力でサポートします！", "zh": "正是如此，所以请你要有自信喔。\n我也会继续全力支援梓小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "5077206c3000c62cc9a274ca470a328f70156a63a426040c0b83a9c80f0fa651", "ja": "……ありがとうございます。そう言ってもらえる事が、\n何よりの自信に……。ふふっ。", "zh": "……谢谢你。能听到你对我说这些，\n就是我最大的自信来源……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0073_1020_010azu", "source_sha256": "af8aa9700303a1f43cdd51a483aac06015df224c6929f9c2c8b0ab8250d53987", "ja": "じゃあさっそく、ダンスを見ていただいていいですか？\n気になるところがあったら、遠慮なくお願いしますね。", "zh": "那么可以现在就请你帮忙确认我的舞蹈吗？\n如果有不对劲的地方，别客气尽管说出来喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
